	(text "One Teensy 4.1 for drive, comms and arm CAN: the PDP has one Teensy4.1_+ and one CAN_TRAN_+ branch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 205.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9cf5b28b-beed-417e-a111-e809d1a4c86d"))
	(text "Teensy pins: PJRC Teensy 4.1 pinout card. Drive and encoder pins copied from the Drivetrain sheet (its Teensy U1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 210.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "97a38f27-fde4-4855-8d1f-cc315a0d1452"))
	(text "Teensy USB to Jetson USB = Task 3 serial link. Cut the VIN-VUSB pads: Teensy runs from VIN (PJRC)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 215.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "a41bab77-b904-4ffe-ab03-2da2e031ade4"))
	(text "Spare: 0/1 (Serial1, CAN2), 7/8 (Serial2), 18/19 (I2C), 30/31 (CAN3). Reserved for cooling: 10 FAN_PWM, 11 FAN_TACH, 12 ONEWIRE." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 220.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "1792d398-edb0-49b6-94ca-bc09c73740c9"))
	(text "Pin 13 also drives the onboard LED; ENC6_B sits on it (from Drivetrain). Check with Krishna." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 225.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "72f07965-4b7b-4165-812f-331d466dc37a"))
	(text "Jetson J301 pins from JetsonHacks Orin Nano header table: 8 UART1_TX, 10 UART1_RX, 3/5 I2C bus 7, 29 GPIO01. Check vs NVIDIA P3768 spec." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 230.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2d378296-5a8d-4989-9b1b-63dd89628629"))
	(text "Jetson J301 power pins left open: the Jetson is powered from PDP JETSON+ (12 V). GND pins join the system ground." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 235.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "fc7666da-6f51-42ab-bed3-2670aa2d4956"))
	(text "CAN: R301 120 ohm terminates this end; the other end is on the Robo Arm. SN65HVD230 Rs to GND = high-speed mode." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 240.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "a8d8a010-b236-41ed-970c-5743406ed52b"))
